<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
<h3 itemprop="name">What formats does the XTEINK X4 Classic support?</h3>
<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
<div itemprop="text">
<p>The X4 Classic supports EPUB, TXT, MOBI, and PDF. It does not support Amazon's KFX, AZW, or AZW3 formats, nor Kobo's KEPUB format. If your library is mostly sideloaded EPUB files — including EPUBs generated by converter-epub.com or by Calibre — the X4 Classic opens them natively. If your library is mostly Kindle Store purchases, you will need to convert them with Calibre before they will open on the X4 Classic.</p>
