<div itemprop="text">
<p>No. The X4 Classic has no front light. The 4.3-inch E Ink panel relies on ambient lighting. For dim environments you will need an external clip-on reading light — the same accessory you would use with the original Xteink X4. If you regularly read in bed, on a plane, or in dim cafes, the X4 Pro (which has a front light) is the better pick despite the higher price.</p>
