<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
<h3 itemprop="name">How long does the battery last?</h3>
<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
<div itemprop="text">
<p>XTEINK rates the 920 mAh battery for roughly a month of regular reading, which aligns with Good e-Reader's launch coverage. The real-world runtime depends on Wi-Fi usage (the radio is the biggest battery draw), how often the screen refreshes, and whether you use Bluetooth. For most readers who turn Wi-Fi off except for occasional library sync, a multi-week runtime on a single charge is realistic.</p>
</div>
</div>
